ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">iOS 27 Beta代码曝光四项Apple Intelligence新功能，强化视觉智能与自动化交互</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Cerebras签署200亿美元芯片协议并获得认股权证入股</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 正式发布 Claude Opus 4.7 模型，强化软件工程与视觉处理能力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌开源医疗AI模型MedGemma 1.5，新增3D影像分析与病理切片处理能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a6315d9ca34cd01d8d64b38d0f4ce411.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式开源医疗AI模型MedGemma 1.5，该模型在保持4B参数量不变的前提下，实现了从2D到3D医疗数据处理的重大跨越。MedGemma 1.5原生支持CT与MRI三维扫描数据分析，可处理包含数十个切片的立体影像，并具备全视野病理数字切片分析、胸部X光精准定位及多时间点病情对比能力。此外，模型对PDF格式电子病历的结构化数据提取能力显著增强。性能方面，相比MedGemma 14B，新版本在3D MRI分类准确率上提升11%，全视野病理图像宏观F1分数提升47%，胸部X光解剖定位交并比增加35%。技术上，团队通过将3D CT切分为序列图像进行预处理，并引入领域专家模型进行知识蒸馏。谷歌明确该模型定位为开发者基础资源，非开箱即用的临床决策工具，落地需针对具体场景进行专项微调。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动启动首轮豆包股回购，回购价格较授予价溢价30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bd21017063adeaca63adf981fa28357.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动于4月15日正式启动“豆包股”首次回购，回购价格定为13.08美元，较2025年10月授予时的10美元上涨约30%。该激励计划专为豆包大模型业务定制，采用类似期权的虚拟股回购机制，目前已在负责预训练与前沿探索的Seed部门全面推行。此次回购溢价反映了字节跳动大模型业务的估值增长，旨在通过将业务价值直接货币化，为核心技术人员提供显著的账面收益与退出渠道。通过建立独立的豆包股回购闭环，字节跳动试图在激烈的全球AI人才竞争中，构建比传统SaaS厂商更具弹性的分配机制，以降低核心人才流失风险，并为大模型业务的长期独立发展提供财务与机制保障。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">iOS 27 Beta代码曝光四项Apple Intelligence新功能，强化视觉智能与自动化交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9554920f813b8c3e52ead50a3350ff56.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">iOS 27 Beta版后端代码显示，苹果计划引入四项Apple Intelligence新功能，旨在深化视觉智能与系统自动化交互。核心升级包括：视觉智能新增营养标签解析，可自动提取食品数据并同步至“健康”应用；纸面信息识别功能增强，支持从印刷品提取电话与地址并存入通讯录。此外，钱包应用将支持实体卡券数字化扫描，Safari浏览器则引入基于网页主题的智能标签组自动命名功能。这些更新不仅优化了iPhone日常交互体验，还被视为苹果为未来智能眼镜及带摄像头AirPods等可穿戴硬件生态铺路。苹果预计将于2026年6月WWDC大会正式发布iOS 27，并于9月随新一代iPhone同步上线正式版。此次更新通过跨应用Siri整合，进一步提升了Apple Intelligence的实用化水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Cerebras签署200亿美元芯片协议并获得认股权证入股</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bcc90ae280ae1fccd3afc68edf3fc9b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与AI芯片初创公司Cerebras达成长期合作，承诺在未来三年内支付超200亿美元用于使用其芯片驱动的服务器集群，并获得Cerebras少数股权认股权证。此外，OpenAI将注资约10亿美元专项建设高性能数据中心。Cerebras核心技术为晶圆级引擎（WSE），其显存访问速度优于传统GPU，旨在助力OpenAI优化下一代推理模型（如Opus 4.7）的响应延迟。此举标志着OpenAI通过多元化硬件布局，引入Cerebras、AMD及自研芯片构建混合架构，以降低计算成本并减少对NVIDIA的依赖。该合作被视为AI基础设施领域的分水岭，旨在破解当前算力市场的垄断格局，对底层算力供应及SaaS行业格局产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 正式发布 Claude Opus 4.7 模型，强化软件工程与视觉处理能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c2d1bd205adc8d5307b379dbc9d134bc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 正式发布全新人工智能模型 Claude Opus 4.7，在高级软件工程、指令执行及视觉处理领域实现显著性能提升。该模型支持识别长边达 2,576 像素的图像，并引入自我验证机制以提升结果准确性。安全性方面，Opus 4.7 内置网络安全防护，可自动拦截高风险请求。在内存管理上，模型优化了长会话中的信息留存能力，降低了对上下文的依赖。定价维持与 Opus 4.6 一致，输入为每百万 token 5 美元，输出为每百万 token 25 美元。Anthropic 同时推出了更精细的难度控制与任务预算功能。目前，Opus 4.7 已通过 Claude 平台及 API、Amazon Bedrock、Google Cloud Vertex AI 和 Microsoft Foundry 全面上线。官方</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
